        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>The Placebo Effect: Are Expensive Placebos More Effective Than Cheap Placebos?</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n  src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/mathjax/3.2.2/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\">\n</script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-family: 'Trebuchet MS', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    color: #ffffff;\n  }\n  .page {\n    max-width: 816px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #ffffff;\n  }\n  header.title-banner {\n    background: #7c76b3;\n    padding: 30px 50px 40px 50px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  header.title-banner h1 {\n    font-size: 28px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin: 4px 0;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n  .content-wrap {\n    padding: 0 35px;\n  }\n  .section {\n    padding: 35px 40px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 30px;\n  }\n  .section.teal { background: #4fb8c3; }\n  .section.purple { background: #8b83c4; }\n  .icons-col {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n    flex: 0 0 320px;\n  }\n  .text-col {\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n  .text-col h2 {\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n  }\n  .text-col p {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n  }\n  .shelf {\n    height: 22px;\n    margin: 0 0;\n  }\n  .shelf.light-teal { background: #7fd0d8; }\n  .shelf.light-purple { background: #a6a0d6; }\n\n  .placeholder {\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);\n    border: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    text-align: center;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .method-results {\n    background: #4fb8c3;\n    padding: 35px 40px 20px 40px;\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 40px;\n  }\n  .method-results .col {\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n  .method-results h2 {\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n  }\n  .method-results p {\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    margin: 0 0 16px 0;\n  }\n  .icons-row-bottom {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n    gap: 15px;\n    padding: 10px 40px 30px 40px;\n    background: #4fb8c3;\n  }\n\n  footer {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 20px 35px;\n    gap: 25px;\n  }\n  footer .logo {\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #4a4a8a;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  footer .refs {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #4fb8c3;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  footer .refs .study-line {\n    color: #6b6b8f;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin-bottom: 3px;\n  }\n  footer .refs .ref-label {\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <header class=\"title-banner\">\n    <h1>The Placebo Effect: Are Expensive Placebos<br>More Effective Than Cheap Placebos?</h1>\n  </header>\n\n  <!-- Purpose Section -->\n  <div class=\"section teal\">\n    <div class=\"icons-col\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:110px;height:110px;\">[Icon: dollar bill / receipt graphic]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:70px;height:110px;\">[Icon: pill bottle]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"text-col\">\n      <h2>Purpose</h2>\n      <p>In what ways can fictitious costs impact the effectiveness of a placebo? To better understand how the 'placebo effect' takes place, we will provide placebos of different reported costs and measure their impact on the patients.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"shelf light-teal\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Hypothesis Section -->\n  <div class=\"section purple\">\n    <div class=\"icons-col\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:90px;height:100px;\">[Icon: capsule pill]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:70px;height:100px;\">[Icon: stacked coins]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:55px;height:100px;\">[Icon: cash bill]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"text-col\">\n      <h2>Hypothesis</h2>\n      <p>Providing placebos that are 'expensive' will amplify the placebo effect of actual placebos with participants.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"shelf light-purple\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Method / Results Section -->\n  <div class=\"method-results\">\n    <div class=\"col\">\n      <h2>Method</h2>\n      <p>Participants suffering from Parkinson's Disease serve as placebo effect test subjects.</p>\n      <p>Each participant receives an effective drug valued at $100 per dose and then motor function changes are measured. After each participant receives an effective drug said to be valued at $1500 per dose, then their motor functions are measured again.</p>\n      <p>A comparison between motor function improvements following the administration of each placebo will help determine whether fictitious costs can influence the effectiveness of a placebo.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col\">\n      <h2>Results</h2>\n      <p>The study found motor functions improve significantly more for participants following the administration of a reportedly $1500 placebo, compared to a reportedly $100 placebo.</p>\n      <p>While the degree of improvement in motor function for participants varied due to the administration of a $1500 placebo drug, all participants experienced improved motor functions. A higher cost for a placebo will improve patients' conditions even more.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"icons-row-bottom\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:100px;height:110px;\">[Icon: medical first-aid kit]</div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:80px;height:110px;\">[Icon: medical clipboard]</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"shelf light-teal\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Footer -->\n  <footer>\n    <div class=\"logo\">M.I.S.H.B</div>\n    <div class=\"refs\">\n      <div class=\"study-line\">Study by Janelle Mauricio, Vanessa Garby, Shivinder Singh - The Massy Institute for Studies of Human Behavior</div>\n      <div><span class=\"ref-label\">References:</span> Kemputo, Odelle., \"The psychology of self-deception\" The Anaptic Journal, 2017 // Satuda, Evan., Temitope, Andrew., \"Neuroscience of Decision-Making\" The Science Review, 2018 // Brahms, Hansen., Leigh, Anderson., \"The Need and Neurology for Happiness\", The Arch Journal, 2020</div>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
